  "instructions": [
    "Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat and add 1 tbsp of olive oil.",
    "Add sliced chicken and cook until browned on all sides, about 5-6 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Remove chicken from the skillet and set aside; add the remaining 1 tbsp oil to the same pan.",
    "Stir-fry the sliced bell pepper, onion, and minced garlic until vegetables are tender-crisp, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Return the chicken to the pan and pour in the coconut cream, tamari, and lemon juice, stirring to combine.",
    "Add the dried chili flakes, chopped cilantro, sea salt, and black pepper; simmer for an additional 3-4 minutes until the sauce thickens.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning, ensuring the chicken reaches an internal temperature of 165°F (74°C) for safe consumption.",
    "Serve hot over rice or quinoa, garnished with extra cilantro if desired."
  ],
